    "body": "This PR addresses the issue where READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE and WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE permissions are restricted on Android 10+ due to Scoped Storage. The changes ensure proper file access based on API levels.\r\n\r\nPlease consider releasing a new version with this fix.\r\n\r\n",
